   * This endpoint allows customers to request refunds for order items that have been delivered. Refund requests must be made within 7 days of delivery confirmation.
   *
   * **Eligibility Requirements:**
   * - Order item must have status "delivered"
   * - Delivery must be within 7 days of the current date
   * - Customer must be the owner of the order item
   * - Order item must not already have a pending or processed refund
   *
   * **Request Process:**
   * 1. Customer submits refund request with reason
   * 2. System validates eligibility (status, time window)
   * 3. Refund request created with status "pending"
   * 4. Seller receives notification to approve or reject
   * 5. If approved, item status changes to "refunded", stock is restored, and refund is processed
   * 6. If rejected, item status remains unchanged
   *
   * **Related Operations:**
   * - GET /sellers/refund-requests - List pending refund requests (seller)
   * - PUT /sellers/refund-requests/{requestId}/approve - Approve refund (seller)
